  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A shaft of lunar light sears a creature you can see within range, which makes a Dexterity saving throw. On a failure, it takes 2d8 Radiant damage, sheds Dim Light in a 10-foot radius, and can’t benefit from the &amp;Reference[invisible apply=false]{Invisible} condition until the end of its next turn. At the end of that turn, it takes an extra 1d8 Radiant damage and the spell ends. On a success, it only takes half the initial damage.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> Both the initial and the later damage increase by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 1.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-MWUVVBgcUDU7Ykiw\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>On a failed save, use <em>Lunar Burn</em> at the end of the target’s next turn, choosing the level you cast the spell at.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
